<title>UK: SBC Warburg sets warrants on ABB AG.</title>
<headline>SBC Warburg sets warrants on ABB AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued three million American-style call warrants on ABB AG bearer shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>Twenty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1625 CHF		  PREMIUM	7.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.15 CHF		  GEARING	15.6 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	07.NOV.97		 PAYDATE	28.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1609 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
